The principal weaknesses are: (ii) the paper conflates "720 trans-GZK UHECRs" with "72 cosmic rays above the GZK limit" in Figure 3;

2.  Inconsistency in the size of the analysed dataset (Sec. 3, Fig. 3, Sec. 4). The text in Sec. 3 says "the 36 most energetic events of the 720 trans-GZK UHECRs" but Appendix A's Table 2 lists ~36 entries, and the Fig. 3 caption says "72 cosmic rays above the GZK limit".

2.  [✖] **Sample size: "720 trans-GZK UHECRs" (Sec. 3) vs. "72 cosmic rays above the GZK limit" (Fig. 3 caption).**
